; Undercity's one theme (CLAUDE.md 6.4, 8): every colour role, font and font size the Undercity
; screens use. The palette is the design page's :root (docs/design/src/head.html); the type is
; its four families. Scripts read colours by role, GetThemeColor("accent", "Palette"), never hex.

